    {
      "subId": "7304922",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Oleg, who will check your watchword",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "730492201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "730492201": {
            "id": "730492201",
            "speakerId": 20712,
            "speakerName": "Oleg",
            "text": "Eh? No way... Ahem, watchword, please. \"Never bring your own rule book...\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730492202"
            ]
          },
          "730492202": {
            "id": "730492202",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "\"To someone else's place.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730492203"
            ]
          },
          "730492203": {
            "id": "730492203",
            "speakerId": 20712,
            "speakerName": "Oleg",
            "text": "Hmph, come in already, you... Hmph, you must be the newbies here for support. What took you so long?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7304923",
      "subQuestName": "Follow Oleg",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7304906",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Oleg",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "730490601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "730490601": {
            "id": "730490601",
            "speakerId": 20712,
            "speakerName": "Oleg",
            "text": "You have no idea how important this experiment is! You are not only late, but...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730490602"
            ]
          },
          "730490602": {
            "id": "730490602",
            "speakerId": 20712,
            "speakerName": "Oleg",
            "text": "Hmph, and you took over the camps, stopped the Saghira Machines, and interrupted our experiment!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730490603"
            ]
          },
          "730490603": {
            "id": "730490603",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Uh-oh!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730490604"
            ]
          },
          "730490604": {
            "id": "730490604",
            "speakerId": 20712,
            "speakerName": "Oleg",
            "text": "Come on, I've been attacked... I've fought you three times... What made you think you could fool me with a mask...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730490605"
            ]
          },
          "730490605": {
            "id": "730490605",
            "speakerId": 20712,
            "speakerName": "Oleg",
            "text": "Do you know why I let you in even after I recognized you? Well, it's a trap!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730490606"
            ]
          },
          "730490606": {
            "id": "730490606",
            "speakerId": 20712,
            "speakerName": "Oleg",
            "text": "#Get {F#her}{M#him}! This is the brat that hampered our experiment!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7304924",
      "subQuestName": "Fight Oleg",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7304925",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Oleg",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "730492501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "730492501": {
            "id": "730492501",
            "speakerId": 20712,
            "speakerName": "Oleg",
            "text": "We were actually defeated... even with so many members...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730492502"
            ]
          },
          "730492502": {
            "id": "730492502",
            "speakerId": 20712,
            "speakerName": "Oleg",
            "text": "If only the experiments went well, I would...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730492503"
            ]
          },
          "730492503": {
            "id": "730492503",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Nah, that's not gonna happen. The machine named San-something from Kasim won't extract anything from the Withering Zones...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730492504"
            ]
          },
          "730492504": {
            "id": "730492504",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "That's to say, he's been lying to you all this time!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730492505"
            ]
          },
          "730492505": {
            "id": "730492505",
            "speakerId": 20712,
            "speakerName": "Oleg",
            "text": "Just how!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730492506"
            ]
          },
          "730492506": {
            "id": "730492506",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "You can repent all you want with the Corps of Thirty, and remember to stay away from Sumeru for the rest of your life!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730492507"
            ]
          },
          "730492507": {
            "id": "730492507",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "You inform Parchamdar Rukh Shah from the Corps of Thirty.\\nHe and his subordinates take the Fatui away."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7304926",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Rukh Shah",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "730492601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "730492601": {
            "id": "730492601",
            "speakerId": 4066,
            "speakerName": "Rukh Shah",
            "text": "Were it not for you, we'd never have known what suspicious things the camp has been used for... We will take away these Fatui.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730492602"
            ]
          },
          "730492602": {
            "id": "730492602",
            "speakerId": 4066,
            "speakerName": "Rukh Shah",
            "text": "According to researchers' investigation, even though no influence was exerted on the Withering Zones, the mere operation of the machines has somehow polluted the environment. If we failed to stop them in time...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730492603"
            ]
          },
          "730492603": {
            "id": "730492603",
            "speakerId": 4066,
            "speakerName": "Rukh Shah",
            "text": "The forest might be damaged.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730492604"
            ]
          },
          "730492604": {
            "id": "730492604",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I see...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730492605"
            ]
          },
          "730492605": {
            "id": "730492605",
            "speakerId": 4066,
            "speakerName": "Rukh Shah",
            "text": "Yes, the Corps of Thirty will take custody of these machines, and similar incidents should be prevented in the future...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730492606"
            ]
          },
          "730492606": {
            "id": "730492606",
            "speakerId": 4066,
            "speakerName": "Rukh Shah",
            "text": "But due to ownership issues, it may not be possible to bring all the camps under our direct management... I won't be too worried about it though.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730492607"
            ]
          },
          "730492607": {
            "id": "730492607",
            "speakerId": 4066,
            "speakerName": "Rukh Shah",
            "text": "Besides, the bounty on Kasim has been raised according to your report... That guy has always been a fraud that gives us headaches.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730492608"
            ]
          },
          "730492608": {
            "id": "730492608",
            "speakerId": 4066,
            "speakerName": "Rukh Shah",
            "text": "Even those Eremite mercenaries fell for his scam this time. He went behind the Corps of Thirty and contacted them directly, offering to share a huge payout for extracting energy from the Ley Lines...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730492609"
            ]
          },
          "730492609": {
            "id": "730492609",
            "speakerId": 4066,
            "speakerName": "Rukh Shah",
            "text": "Never mind. I'll teach him a lesson the next time I see him!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730492610"
            ]
          },
          "730492610": {
            "id": "730492610",
            "speakerId": 4066,
            "speakerName": "Rukh Shah",
            "text": "Here, take your rewards for turning in the Fatui! We caught them all thanks to you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730492611"
            ]
          },
          "730492611": {
            "id": "730492611",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "Rukh Shah leaves..."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}